    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Exodus of Souls is an action-adventure RPG, based on Nordic/Baltic epics. It is being developed by a souls-like lover team with dedication and love! <br><br><strong>STORY</strong><br>After the Great Hilleviones War, Kalev, The King of Kalevia, stopped the war and ruled the 7 Kingdoms of Hilleviones with the sword Magnus Gladius, forged with 7-kingdoms\u2019 soil. He knew that any peace cannot last forever, he sent his newborn son Sohni, to Valjaran.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/d836bc402ad7d8cd1b669f4715ab5eee.poster.avif?t=1678200131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/d836bc402ad7d8cd1b669f4715ab5eee.webm?t=1678200131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/d836bc402ad7d8cd1b669f4715ab5eee.mp4?t=1678200131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Sohni grew up as a blacksmith and he has never been told that he was the heir to the throne of Kalevia until the time came.<br>After 48 years of silence, the fight between Ungannians and Tariens sparked the fire and spread the disorder to the other kingdoms.<br><br>Sohni, as an heir to the throne, needs to get the Magnus Gladius and rule the 7 Kingdoms of Hilleviones again.<br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your character</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rebuilt your kingdom</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense swordplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clash with epic enemies in epic atmospheres</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gather souls and unleash your wrath on your enemies</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/54a8b7528ced1c218c9e94af38c091d4.poster.avif?t=1678200131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/54a8b7528ced1c218c9e94af38c091d4.webm?t=1678200131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/54a8b7528ced1c218c9e94af38c091d4.mp4?t=1678200131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Exodus of Souls is an action-adventure RPG, based on Nordic/Baltic epics. It is being developed by a souls-like lover team with dedication and love! <br><br><strong>STORY</strong><br>After the Great Hilleviones War, Kalev, The King of Kalevia, stopped the war and ruled the 7 Kingdoms of Hilleviones with the sword Magnus Gladius, forged with 7-kingdoms\u2019 soil. He knew that any peace cannot last forever, he sent his newborn son Sohni, to Valjaran.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/d836bc402ad7d8cd1b669f4715ab5eee.poster.avif?t=1678200131\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/d836bc402ad7d8cd1b669f4715ab5eee.webm?t=1678200131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/extras/d836bc402ad7d8cd1b669f4715ab5eee.mp4?t=1678200131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Sohni grew up as a blacksmith and he has never been told that he was the heir to the throne of Kalevia until the time came.<br>After 48 years of silence, the fight between Ungannians and Tariens sparked the fire and spread the disorder to the other kingdoms.<br><br>Sohni, as an heir to the throne, needs to get the Magnus Gladius and rule the 7 Kingdoms of Hilleviones again.<br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Upgrade your character</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rebuilt your kingdom</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Intense swordplay</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Clash with epic enemies in epic atmospheres</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Gather souls and unleash your wrath on your enemies</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2095620/ex